lynx tui — a terminal interface library for Go

This product includes work derived from agentui
(https://github.com/minoism/agentui), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

The packages under primitives/ are a reimplementation of agentui's
rendering substrate: the cell grid and its minimal escape-stream emission
(primitives/grid, from agentui's cellbuf), column-aware wrapping (primitives/text,
from agentui's textwrap), terminal ownership and input decoding (primitives/term and
primitives/input, from agentui's term), and frame pacing with in-flight gating
(primitives/present, from agentui's present).

agentui states that it is itself an independent Go reimplementation of the
terminal interface of Grok CLI (https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build), and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by xAI.

